《美人鱼与藤壶男孩》
我的录像机没有录制它

08:07.379 --> 08:10.620
and now I'll never see it
and my life has no meaning.
现在我再也看不到它了
我的生活没有任何意义。

08:10.689 --> 08:13.931
[crying]
[哭泣]

08:16.655 --> 08:17.862
[glass shattering]
[玻璃破碎]

08:17.931 --> 08:19.310
- All right, listen up.
- 好吧，听着。

08:19.379 --> 08:21.206
SpongeBob has helped
every single one of us
海绵宝宝帮忙了
我们每一个人

08:21.275 --> 08:22.689
dozens of times over.
几十次以上。

08:22.758 --> 08:24.551
But we ain't been very
helpful to him today.
但我们并没有很
今天对他有帮助。

08:24.620 --> 08:26.206
- Yeah, I was a lousy friend.
- 是的，我是一个糟糕的朋友。

08:26.275 --> 08:29.137
- Now, we may have taken
advantage of his kindness,
- 现在，我们可能已经采取了
凭借他的善良，

08:29.206 --> 08:32.758
but I got a plan
to make things right.
但我有一个计划
使事情正确。

08:32.827 --> 08:34.931
[whispering]
[耳语]

08:35.000 --> 08:36.586
narrator: The next day.
旁白：第二天。

08:36.655 --> 08:39.448
[tropical music]
[热带音乐]

08:39.517 --> 08:43.793
- [muttering]
- [嘀咕]

08:43.862 --> 08:45.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:45.137 --> 08:47.034
Play.
玩。

08:47.103 --> 08:49.137
[swallowing]
[吞咽]

08:49.206 --> 08:51.034
[chewing]
[咀嚼]

08:51.103 --> 08:52.034
[knocking]
[敲门声]

08:52.103 --> 08:53.379
[groaning]
[呻吟]

08:53.448 --> 08:56.241
- Hey there, SpongeBob.
Feeling any better?
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。
感觉好些了吗？

08:56.310 --> 08:58.620
- [muttering]
- [嘀咕]

08:58.689 --> 09:01.000
- Aww, why don't you
come with me?
- 哇哦，你为什么不呢？
跟我来吗？

09:01.068 --> 09:03.137
I have a little
surprise for you.
我有一点
给你惊喜。

09:03.206 --> 09:05.413
- I'm not really in the mood,
Sandy.
-我实在没心情
桑迪。

09:05.482 --> 09:08.103
- Aww, quit acting like
a calf with colic.
- 哇哦，别再表现得像
患有肠绞痛的小牛。

09:08.172 --> 09:11.206
- [groans]
- Come on, SpongeBob.
- [呻吟]
- 来吧，海绵宝宝。

09:11.275 --> 09:13.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:13.310 --> 09:14.655
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

09:14.724 --> 09:17.310
Gee, Sandy, where'd you get
an outdoor amphitheater?
哎呀，桑迪，你从哪里来的？
室外露天剧场？

09:17.379 --> 09:18.586
- Don't worry about that.
- 别担心这个。

09:18.655 --> 09:21.517
Just sit right here
and enjoy the play.
就坐在这里
并享受比赛。

09:21.586 --> 09:23.586
- Oh, okay.
- 哦好的。

09:23.655 --> 09:25.724
[piano music]
[钢琴音乐]

09:25.793 --> 09:27.241
- [groans]
[microphone squeals]
- [呻吟]
[麦克风尖叫声]

09:27.310 --> 09:31.275
[humming]
Welcome, ladies and morons!
[嗡嗡声]
欢迎，女士们和白痴们！

09:31.344 --> 09:34.896
It's time for the exciting
conclusion to...
激动人心的时刻到了
结论是……

09:34.965 --> 09:38.379
"The Case of the Curious
Cliffhanger!"
《好奇者的案例》
悬崖勒马！”

09:38.448 --> 09:39.413
[laughs]
[笑]

09:39.482 --> 09:42.275
- Huh?
Whoa!
- 啊？
哇！

09:42.344 --> 09:43.931
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:44.000 --> 09:48.724
- Help me, Barnacleboy.
I'm hanging...
- 帮帮我，藤壶男孩。
我挂了...

09:48.793 --> 09:50.379
from this cliff.
从这个悬崖。

09:50.448 --> 09:54.034
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

09:54.103 --> 09:57.689
- And look, I am also
hanging from this cliff.
- 看吧，我也是
悬挂在这个悬崖上。

09:57.758 --> 10:00.413
We sure are in danger.
我们确实处于危险之中。

10:00.482 --> 10:04.379
- [shudders]
- [颤抖]

10:04.448 --> 10:05.862
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:05.931 --> 10:08.344
You should give up
while you can, Mermaidman.
你应该放弃
while you can, Mermaidman.

10:08.413 --> 10:11.344
both: [grunting]
两人：[咕哝]

10:11.413 --> 10:13.620
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:13.689 --> 10:14.862
[shouts]
[喊叫]

10:14.931 --> 10:17.172
- Haven't you heard,
Captain Tightwad?
- 你没听说过吗
船长太紧了？

10:17.241 --> 10:21.896
I'll never give up fighting...
Um...
我永远不会放弃战斗...
嗯...

10:21.965 --> 10:24.827
Line?
- Oh, um...
线？
- 哦，嗯...

10:24.896 --> 10:28.931
Evil.
- Evil!
邪恶的。
- 邪恶的！

10:29.000 --> 10:31.344
- Hmm?
[groans]
- 唔？
[呻吟]

10:31.413 --> 10:33.241
- [shouts]
- [喊叫]

10:33.310 --> 10:34.517
- Wow!
- 哇！

10:34.586 --> 10:37.896
Yes, yes!
是的，是的！

10:37.965 --> 10:40.517
all: ♪ He may be half
a mermaid ♪
所有人：♪ 他可能是一半
一条美人鱼♪

10:40.586 --> 10:42.793
♪ And he may be half a man ♪
♪ 他可能是半个男人 ♪

10:42.862 --> 10:45.000
♪ But to us he's more
than a hero ♪
♪ 但对我们来说他更重要
比英雄♪

10:45.068 --> 10:50.206
♪ He's our Mermaidman ♪
♪ 他是我们的美人鱼 ♪

10:50.275 --> 10:51.758
- [moaning]
- [呻吟]

10:51.827 --> 10:54.620
[whistles]
[口哨声]

10:54.689 --> 10:56.931
Ah, oh, bravo!
Bravo!
啊，哦，太棒了！
太棒了！

10:57.000 --> 11:01.931
Bravo!
[laughing]
太棒了！
[笑]

11:02.000 --> 11:04.655
Yes!
Ah!
是的！
啊!

11:04.724 --> 11:07.724
Thank you, everyone.
I loved the show.
谢谢大家。
我喜欢这个节目。

11:07.793 --> 11:10.275
And I loved the love
you showed me.
我爱过这份爱
你给我看了。

11:10.344 --> 11:13.448
And I loved how you showed me
the love you showed me
我喜欢你向我展示的方式
你向我展示的爱

11:13.517 --> 11:15.551
in the show I love.
在我喜欢的节目中。

11:15.620 --> 11:19.206
This is my favorite episode
of "Mermaidman" ever.
这是我最喜欢的一集
曾经的“美人鱼”。

11:19.275 --> 11:21.310
all: [cheering]
全体：[欢呼]

11:21.379 --> 11:22.965
- Ahem.
Hey!
- 咳咳。
嘿！

11:23.034 --> 11:26.310
What are you kids doing
in my outdoor amphitheater?
你们孩子在做什么
在我的露天剧场？

11:26.379 --> 11:28.241
- [screams]
Cheese it, everyone!
- [尖叫]
大家来干酪吧！

11:28.310 --> 11:30.724
It's Old Man Jenkins!
[screams]
这是老詹金斯！
[尖叫声]

11:30.793 --> 11:31.896
- Come back!
- 回来吧！

11:31.965 --> 11:34.793
I just wanna be in the play.
我只是想参加戏。

11:34.862 --> 11:37.620
- Aww, I'll play with you,
Old Man Jenkins.
- 哇哦，我会和你一起玩，
老詹金斯。

11:37.689 --> 11:39.137
Do you wanna be Mermaidman?
你想成为美人鱼吗？

11:39.206 --> 11:43.310
- It's the role of my dreams.
- 这是我梦想的角色。

11:43.379 --> 11:45.206
Zoom!
飞涨！

11:45.275 --> 11:47.551
[laughs]
[笑]

11:47.620 --> 11:48.551
Whoo!
呼！

11:48.620 --> 11:49.862
- [laughs]
- [笑]

11:52.965 --> 11:55.896
[spooky music]
[诡异的音乐]

11:55.965 --> 12:01.965
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:02.034 --> 12:05.068
- Oh, it was so great
catching up with you Hannah.
- 哦，太棒了
追上你汉娜。

12:05.137 --> 12:07.620
- Oh.
- It's been too long.
- 哦。
- 已经太久了。

12:07.689 --> 12:09.206
- [sneezes]
- [打喷嚏]

12:09.275 --> 12:12.137
- Oh, you poor thing.
Sounds like you have a bug.
-哦，你这个可怜的东西。
听起来你有一个错误。

12:12.206 --> 12:14.172
Better go home and reboot.
最好回家重新启动。

12:14.241 --> 12:16.655
Remember, only keywords
tonight.
记住，只有关键词
今晚。

12:16.724 --> 12:18.379
You need to rest
your processor.
你需要休息
你的处理器。

12:18.448 --> 12:19.413
- Karen!
- 凯伦！

12:19.482 --> 12:20.896
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

12:20.965 --> 12:24.172
- What do you want?
[sneezes]
- 你想要什么？
[打喷嚏]

12:24.241 --> 12:25.758
[groans]
[呻吟]

12:25.827 --> 12:28.241
- Oh, no.
Your nodes are swollen.
- 哦，不。
你的节点肿胀。

12:28.310 --> 12:31.448
That old bucket of bolts
gave you a computer virus.
那桶旧螺栓
给你带来了计算机病毒。

12:31.517 --> 12:34.793
- Oh, nonsense.
I'm the fastest computer alive.
-哦，废话。
我是世界上最快的计算机。

12:34.862 --> 12:38.344
[stammering]
[结巴]

12:38.413 --> 12:40.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:40.551 --> 12:41.931
[crashes]
[崩溃]

12:42.000 --> 12:44.034
Uh-oh.
[laughs]
呃哦。
[笑]

12:44.103 --> 12:47.724
My ones and zeroes look like
10, 10, 10, 10.
我的 1 和 0 看起来像
10、10、10、10。

12:47.793 --> 12:51.310
- Someone's gonna have to get
inside you and kill that virus.
- 总得有人得到
在你体内并杀死该病毒。

12:51.379 --> 12:53.793
It's probably
a suicide mission.
大概是
自杀任务。

12:53.862 --> 12:56.172
But who would be stupid
enough to--
但谁会傻呢
足以——

12:56.241 --> 12:57.965
[knocking]
- [grunting]
[敲门声]
- [咕哝]

12:58.034 --> 13:01.137
- What now?
- [groans]
- 现在怎么办？
- [呻吟]

13:01.206 --> 13:03.068
- Oh, I'm just helping out
the Health Department.
-哦，我只是帮忙
卫生部门。

13:03.137 --> 13:06.000
- Hmm?
"Sanitary notice.
- 唔？
“卫生通知。

13:06.068 --> 13:08.862
"The Chum Bucket hereby
gets a grade Z
“特此密友桶
获得 Z 级

13:08.931 --> 13:10.344
from the Health Department."
来自卫生部门。”

13:10.413 --> 13:13.689
Hey, that's up from
a negative Z last week.
嘿嘿，这是从
上周Z为负值。

13:13.758 --> 13:15.206
- Congratulations, Plankton.
- 恭喜你，浮游生物。

13:15.275 --> 13:17.517
In a few more years,
you're sure to get an F.
再过几年，
你肯定会得到F。

13:17.586 --> 13:19.310
[groans]
Whoa!
[呻吟]
哇！

13:19.379 --> 13:22.137
- Never mind about that.
I have a snow job--
- 别介意这个。
我有一份雪地工作——

13:22.206 --> 13:25.275
Uh, job for you.
Karen needs your help.
呃，工作给你。
凯伦需要你的帮助。

13:25.344 --> 13:27.689
She asked for you personally.
她亲自来找你。

13:27.758 --> 13:31.862
- ♪ Who lives in the crabapple
under a pea ♪
- ♪ 谁住在海棠里
在豌豆下面♪

13:31.931 --> 13:33.448
- Hey, catchy song.
- 嘿，好听的歌。

13:33.517 --> 13:35.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

13:35.068 --> 13:38.896
- ♪ Observant and yellow
fellow is he ♪
- ♪ 敏锐且黄色
同胞就是他♪

13:38.965 --> 13:41.793
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

13:41.862 --> 13:43.310
- We need a name
for this mission.
- 我们需要一个名字
为了这个使命。

13:43.379 --> 13:46.931
How about, "Journey to
the Center of Karen"?
怎么样，“旅程
凯伦中心”？

13:47.000 --> 13:50.068
No.
"The Mainframe Mission."
不。
“大型机任务。”

13:50.137 --> 13:52.448
Nah.
Ooh, I know.
不。
哦，我知道。

13:52.517 --> 13:54.517
"Operation: Save Karen."
“行动：拯救凯伦。”

13:54.586 --> 13:56.103
[baby giggling]
[宝宝咯咯笑]

13:56.172 --> 13:58.689
- Whatever, just blast
the virus when you see it.
- 无论如何，只是爆炸
当你看到病毒时。

13:58.758 --> 14:00.000
- Oh, like this?
- Hmm?
- 哦，像这样吗？
- 唔？

14:00.068 --> 14:01.862
[lasers screeching]
[激光刺耳]

14:01.931 --> 14:03.827
[explosion]
[爆炸]

14:03.896 --> 14:06.448
Oops.
- That tickles.
哎呀。
- 好痒啊

14:06.517 --> 14:08.586
[laughs]
[笑]

14:08.655 --> 14:10.068
- [blows]
- [打击]

14:10.137 --> 14:12.482
Here, use this.
在这里，用这个。

14:12.551 --> 14:13.896
- But Plankton,
how am I supposed to--
- 但是浮游生物，
我该怎么做——

14:13.965 --> 14:15.310
Whoa!
哇！

14:15.379 --> 14:18.068
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

14:18.137 --> 14:19.586
[laughing]
[笑]

14:19.655 --> 14:21.068
Ow!
噢！

14:21.137 --> 14:22.482
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

14:22.551 --> 14:23.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:23.896 --> 14:26.379
[grunts]
- [laughing]
[咕哝]
- [笑]

14:26.448 --> 14:28.379
- [grunts]
Don't worry, baby.
- [咕哝]
别担心，宝贝。

14:28.448 --> 14:31.034
Help is on the way.
- Get away.
帮助正在路上。
- 逃离。

14:31.103 --> 14:33.620
- [shouting]
- [喊叫]

14:33.689 --> 14:35.482
Ow.
噢。

14:35.551 --> 14:38.482
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

14:38.551 --> 14:42.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:42.827 --> 14:44.379
- [shouting]
- [喊叫]

14:44.448 --> 14:45.689
Whoa.
哇哦。

14:45.758 --> 14:48.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:48.931 --> 14:53.482
Super-awesome-ular-tastic!
Wow!
超级棒-好吃！
哇！

14:53.551 --> 14:55.137
[grunts]
[咕哝]

14:55.206 --> 14:58.931
Huh?
- SpongeBob, can you hear me?
啊？
- 海绵宝宝，你能听到我说话吗？

14:59.000 --> 15:01.965
Come in, SpongeBob.
[groans]
进来吧，海绵宝宝。
[呻吟]

15:02.034 --> 15:04.482
Talk to me,
you digitized doofus!
跟我说话，
你这个数字化的傻瓜！

15:04.551 --> 15:06.862
- Plankton, I do not
respond to insults.
- 浮游生物，我不
回应侮辱。

15:06.931 --> 15:08.724
- [sighs]
Okay.
- [叹气]
好的。

15:08.793 --> 15:12.206
Just look for any destruction
and follow it to the virus.
只是寻找任何破坏
并追踪病毒。

15:12.275 --> 15:15.482
Sweetheart.
- Got it, honey.
亲爱的。
- 明白了，亲爱的。

15:15.551 --> 15:19.965
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

15:20.034 --> 15:23.482
Whoa!
[stammering]
哇！
[结巴]

15:23.551 --> 15:26.034
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

15:26.103 --> 15:28.896
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

15:28.965 --> 15:32.655
[laughs]
I want a Krabby Patty.
[笑]
我想要一个蟹肉饼。

15:32.724 --> 15:33.931
- Baby.
- Bye.
- 婴儿。
- 再见。

15:34.000 --> 15:35.689
- [stammers]
- [结巴]

15:35.758 --> 15:38.310
SpongeBob, hurry up
and kill that virus
海绵宝宝，快点
并杀死该病毒

15:38.379 --> 15:40.862
before it completely
destroys Karen.
在它完全之前
摧毁了凯伦。

15:40.931 --> 15:44.103
- [grunts]
[laughs]
- [咕哝]
[笑]

15:44.172 --> 15:46.379
[glass shattering]
[玻璃破碎]

15:46.448 --> 15:49.310
Knock, knock!
[grunts]
敲，敲！
[咕哝]

15:49.379 --> 15:53.862
- Huh?
Great Neptune's nostrils!
- 啊？
伟大的海王星的鼻孔！

15:53.931 --> 15:55.344
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

15:55.413 --> 15:57.689
- [groans]
[screams]
- [呻吟]
[尖叫声]

15:57.758 --> 15:58.965
Huh?
Hmm.
啊？
唔。

15:59.034 --> 16:01.000
[gasps]
The virus.
[喘气]
病毒。

16:01.068 --> 16:03.275
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

16:03.344 --> 16:05.448
Whoa!
Huh?
哇！
啊？

16:05.517 --> 16:08.137
Plankton, it looks like
the virus is heading
浮游生物，看起来像
病毒正在走向

16:08.206 --> 16:10.172
to Karen's memory banks.
到凯伦的记忆库。

16:10.241 --> 16:12.000
- Listen, if it gets
to her memory,
- 听着，如果有的话
在她的记忆中，

16:12.068 --> 16:14.413
it'll fry her hard
drive completely.
它会把她烤得很硬
完全驾驶。

16:14.482 --> 16:17.551
I need you to destroy
that virus right now!
我需要你摧毁
那个病毒现在！

16:17.620 --> 16:21.034
- Plankton, I need you
to control your wife.
- 浮游生物，我需要你
来控制你的妻子。

16:21.103 --> 16:23.206
Er, computer, or whatever.
呃，电脑，或者其他什么。

16:23.275 --> 16:25.344
- Mind your own business,
Eugene.
- 管好自己的事，
尤金.

16:25.413 --> 16:27.655
- This is my business!
- 这是我的事！

16:27.724 --> 16:30.724
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

16:30.793 --> 16:33.137
Hello there, baby.
你好，宝贝。

16:33.206 --> 16:35.793
Where've you been all my life?
我这辈子你都去哪儿了？

16:35.862 --> 16:37.034
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

16:37.103 --> 16:40.344
Please don't break up
our happy home.
请不要分手
我们幸福的家。

16:40.413 --> 16:44.517
I forgive you, baby.
[kisses]
我原谅你，宝贝。
[亲吻]

16:44.586 --> 16:45.655
Hmm.
唔。

16:45.724 --> 16:47.206
♪ ♪
