[马戏音乐]

17:44.275 --> 17:46.862
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

17:46.931 --> 17:49.827
- Anger control
center abolished.
- 愤怒控制
中心被废除。

17:49.896 --> 17:51.793
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

17:51.862 --> 17:54.689
- Love center destroyed.
- 爱情中心被摧毁。

17:54.758 --> 18:00.068
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

18:00.137 --> 18:01.689
