money, money, money, money...
- 钱，钱，钱，钱，
钱，钱，钱，钱……

18:05.551 --> 18:08.413
- Mr. Krabs, is that you?
- 蟹老板，是你吗？

18:08.482 --> 18:10.620
- It's Karen's
version of Krabs.
- 这是凯伦的
蟹蟹的版本。

18:10.689 --> 18:13.724
- Hey, looking good,
Mr. K.
- 嘿，看起来不错，
K 先生

18:13.793 --> 18:15.344
- I hate everything.
- 我讨厌一切。

18:15.413 --> 18:17.931
- That's how Karen
sees Squidward.
- 凯伦就是这样
看到章鱼哥。

18:18.000 --> 18:19.206
- Hmm?
- 唔？

18:19.275 --> 18:20.586
Uh, nothing a little
makeup couldn't fix.
呃，没什么
化妆无法解决。

18:20.655 --> 18:22.103
[chuckles]
[笑声]

18:22.172 --> 18:24.758
Hey, I wonder if Karen has
a version of me down here.
嘿，我想知道凯伦有没有
这里是我的一个版本。

18:24.827 --> 18:26.206
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

18:26.275 --> 18:29.551
- Woop, woop, zing, zing.
Woop, woop, zing, zing.
- 呜呜，呜呜，叮叮，叮叮。
呜呜呜，叮叮叮。

18:29.620 --> 18:31.724
- Ooh, now that guy's a hunk.
- 哦，现在那家伙是个大块头了。

18:31.793 --> 18:33.000
[sirens blaring]
[警笛鸣响]

18:33.068 --> 18:36.413
- Intruder in section B.
Eliminate.
- B 部分的入侵者。
消除。

18:36.482 --> 18:38.000
all: [grunting]
全体：[咕哝]

18:38.068 --> 18:39.000
[lasers firing]
[激光发射]

18:39.068 --> 18:41.655
both: [grunting]
两人：[咕哝]

18:41.724 --> 18:43.275
Hmm?
[lasers firing]
唔？
[激光发射]

18:43.344 --> 18:45.551
- Ow!
- 噢！

18:45.620 --> 18:48.172
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

18:48.241 --> 18:49.758
- [laughs]
- Yeowch!
- [笑]
- 哟哟！

18:49.827 --> 18:51.620
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

18:51.689 --> 18:53.448
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

18:53.517 --> 18:56.827
- Owie, owie, owie.
- 欧伊，欧伊，欧伊。

18:56.896 --> 18:58.310
- What a drip.
- 真是滴水啊。

18:58.379 --> 19:00.275
- Ai-yi-yi-yi-yi-yi-yi-yi!
- 哎呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀！

19:00.344 --> 19:02.000
- [screams]
- Ai-yi-yi-yi-yi-yi-yi-yi!
- [尖叫]
- 哎呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀！

19:02.068 --> 19:03.000
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

19:03.068 --> 19:04.000
both: [grunting]
两人：[咕哝]

19:04.068 --> 19:05.000
- Duh.
- Duh.
- 呃。
- 呃。

19:05.068 --> 19:06.000
- Doy.
- Doy.
- 多伊。
- 多伊。

19:06.068 --> 19:07.000
- Duh.
- Dun.
- 呃。
- 邓。

19:07.068 --> 19:08.137
- Doy.
- Doy.
- 多伊。
- 多伊。

19:08.206 --> 19:09.827
- Neptune's network!
- 海王星的网络！

19:09.896 --> 19:12.896
Which one of you
is the real SpongeBob?
你们中的哪一个
是真正的海绵宝宝吗？

19:12.965 --> 19:14.965
both: [muttering]
两人：[嘀咕]

19:15.034 --> 19:17.862
- I'll have to use all
the computation power I have
- 我必须用尽一切
我拥有的计算能力

19:17.931 --> 19:20.862
to figure this out.
Eeny, meeny, miney, moe.
弄清楚这一点。
Eeny，meeny，miney，moe。

19:20.931 --> 19:22.965
[laser blasting]
[激光喷砂]

19:23.034 --> 19:26.724
- Duh, duh, doy, doy.
Duh, duh, doy, doy.
- 呃，呃，多伊，多伊。
呃，呃，多伊，多伊。

19:26.793 --> 19:28.034
- Oh, no.
- 哦，不。

19:28.103 --> 19:30.482
I think I destroyed
the wrong SpongeBob.
我想我毁了
错误的海绵宝宝。

19:30.551 --> 19:32.379
- Duh, duh, doy--
[groaning]
- 呃，呃，doy——
[呻吟]

19:32.448 --> 19:34.206
How do I look?
- Stunning.
我看起来怎么样？
- 令人惊叹的。

19:34.275 --> 19:36.137
Whoa!
哇！

19:36.206 --> 19:40.034
- [grunts and shouts]
- [咕哝和喊叫]

19:40.103 --> 19:41.103
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

19:41.172 --> 19:42.103
Hmm.
唔。

19:42.172 --> 19:45.103
Voracious virus!
贪婪的病毒！

19:45.172 --> 19:46.379
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

19:46.448 --> 19:48.896
There's still time
to save Karen.
还有时间
为了拯救凯伦。

19:48.965 --> 19:53.896
[grunts]
[咕哝]

19:53.965 --> 19:55.137
You first.
你先。

19:55.206 --> 19:58.310
- [groans]
[mimics "Tarzan" scream]
- [呻吟]
[模仿“泰山”的尖叫声]

19:58.379 --> 20:01.241
[groans]
Whoops.
[呻吟]
哎呀。

20:01.310 --> 20:02.344
Did I do good?
我做得好吗？

20:02.413 --> 20:04.379
- You did great.
- 你做得很好。

20:04.448 --> 20:07.793
But I think you could use
a little push.
但我认为你可以使用
一点点推动。

20:07.862 --> 20:10.344
- Whoa, okay, your turn.
- 哇，好吧，轮到你了。

20:10.413 --> 20:14.000
- [groans]
It's up to you, SpongeBob.
- [呻吟]
这取决于你，海绵宝宝。

20:14.068 --> 20:16.689
You must save Karen!
你必须救凯伦！

20:16.758 --> 20:19.310
- No!
- 不！

20:19.379 --> 20:22.241
- What do you mean, no?
- 你是什么意思，不？

20:22.310 --> 20:25.620
- I mean,
yes!
- 我的意思是，
是的！

20:25.689 --> 20:26.413
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

20:26.482 --> 20:27.965
- [laughing]
- [笑]

20:28.034 --> 20:31.758
- Uh, sweetie, maybe we should
slow down and pull over.
- 呃，亲爱的，也许我们应该
减速并靠边停车。

20:31.827 --> 20:33.793
Honey?
Precious?
蜂蜜？
宝贵的？

20:33.862 --> 20:37.103
- No way, Plankie!
It's me and you, amigo.
- 不可能，普兰基！
这是我和你，朋友。

20:37.172 --> 20:38.310
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

20:38.379 --> 20:39.586
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

20:39.655 --> 20:42.551
- Oh, hot dog.
Let's go dancing.
- 哦，热狗。
我们去跳舞吧。

20:42.620 --> 20:44.965
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

20:45.034 --> 20:47.758
Whoo-hoo, yeah!
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼，是啊！
呼呼！

20:47.827 --> 20:49.862
- How are all these people
able to dance here
- 这些人都怎么样
能够在这里跳舞

20:49.931 --> 20:53.482
in the middle of the day?
Don't they have jobs?
在中午？
他们没有工作吗？

20:53.551 --> 20:55.275
- Whoo!
[laughs]
- 呼！
[笑]

20:55.344 --> 20:56.517
- Ouch!
- 哎呀！

20:56.586 --> 20:58.724
SpongeBob, come in, SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝，海绵宝宝，进来吧！

20:58.793 --> 21:01.137
If you're gonna do anything,
do it now!
如果你想做点什么
现在就做吧！

21:01.206 --> 21:03.241
Karen's about to melt down!
凯伦快要崩溃了！

21:03.310 --> 21:06.827
- Oh, such a cute
one-eyed baby.
- 哦，真可爱
独眼宝宝。

21:06.896 --> 21:08.931
- SpongeBob!
- 海绵宝宝！

21:09.000 --> 21:12.448
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

21:12.517 --> 21:15.931
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

21:16.000 --> 21:19.379
- Stop munching on those
memories, you monster!
- 别再咀嚼那些了
回忆，你这个怪物！

21:19.448 --> 21:21.413
- [snarls]
- [咆哮]

21:21.482 --> 21:23.310
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

21:23.379 --> 21:24.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:24.896 --> 21:26.586
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

21:26.655 --> 21:29.172
- Hi-ya!
- 嗨呀！

21:29.241 --> 21:31.793
- [snarls]
- [咆哮]

21:31.862 --> 21:34.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:34.965 --> 21:35.965
- Meow?
- 喵？

21:36.034 --> 21:37.310
[groans]
[呻吟]

21:37.379 --> 21:38.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:38.793 --> 21:40.931
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

21:41.000 --> 21:43.620
[groans]
[呻吟]

21:43.689 --> 21:46.172
Plankton, I'm at the edge
of Karen's memory.
浮游生物，我在边缘
凯伦的记忆。

21:46.241 --> 21:48.034
She has to create
more memories.
她必须创造
更多回忆。

21:48.103 --> 21:49.931
I need space to run.
我需要空间来奔跑。

21:50.000 --> 21:51.862
- [shouting]
- [喊叫]

21:51.931 --> 21:56.137
- Is my running after her
enough of a memory?
- 我在追她吗
内存够不够？

21:56.206 --> 21:58.172
- Oh, I'm afraid not.
- 哦，恐怕不是。

21:58.241 --> 22:00.000
[groans]
[呻吟]

22:00.068 --> 22:01.275
- [snarls]
- [咆哮]

22:01.344 --> 22:03.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

22:03.103 --> 22:04.310
Roar!
吼！

22:04.379 --> 22:05.620
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

22:05.689 --> 22:08.379
I always wind up
with one extra piece.
我总是会结束
多加一件。

22:08.448 --> 22:09.551
- [snarls]
- [咆哮]

22:09.620 --> 22:12.000
- Oh, you must be hungry.
- 哦，你一定饿了。

22:12.068 --> 22:14.448
That's why you're eating
through Karen.
这就是你吃饭的原因
通过凯伦.

22:14.517 --> 22:16.689
- I'm always hungry.
- 我总是很饿。

22:16.758 --> 22:19.310
- You poor, ugly,
disgusting little virus.
- 你又穷又丑
恶心的小病毒。

22:19.379 --> 22:20.827
I know what you need.
我知道你需要什么。

22:20.896 --> 22:21.862
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

22:21.931 --> 22:23.827
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

22:23.896 --> 22:26.517
- SpongeBob, I've decided
to pull you out.
- 海绵宝宝，我决定了
把你拉出来。

22:26.586 --> 22:29.689
We're abandoning
Operation: Save Karen.
我们正在放弃
行动：拯救凯伦。

22:29.758 --> 22:32.448
- I got the virus.
Look.
- 我感染了病毒。
看。

22:32.517 --> 22:35.241
- Hmm?
- Hi, there.
- 唔？
- 你好呀。

22:35.310 --> 22:36.586
- Here you go, little fella.
- 给你，小家伙。

22:36.655 --> 22:38.758
It'll take the virus 300
years to chew its
病毒需要300
多年咀嚼它

22:38.827 --> 22:41.379
way through this sandwich.
- Whoo-hoo!
穿过这个三明治。
- 呼呼！

22:41.448 --> 22:42.965
- Oh.
Huh?
- 哦。
啊？

22:43.034 --> 22:45.689
- Baby, you're all right.
- 宝贝，你没事吧。

22:45.758 --> 22:48.310
- Nope, I'm still delirious.
- 不，我还是神志不清。

22:48.379 --> 22:51.103
But I like it!
[laughs]
但我喜欢它！
[笑]

22:51.172 --> 22:55.137
[tropical music]
[热带音乐]

22:55.206 --> 23:02.482
♪ ♪
